sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Slack adapter
  participant H as Hugs
  participant B as Bus
  participant W as Welcome
  participant Q as Quests
  participant I as Items
  participant A as Analytics
  S->>H: giveHug (reaction)
  H->>H: isFirstHug = !hasHuggedBefore
  H->>B: publish hugGiven{first}
  B->>W: welcomeOnHug (own transaction)
  W->>Q: questsFor(member)
  alt not on the Monday path
    W-->>W: legacy: ephemeral first-hug reply stays
  else Monday path, no welcomes row yet
    W->>W: insert welcomes{member, path: hug}
    W->>Q: startQuests(member, "monday-quest")
    W->>Q: nextOnboardingQuestOf(member)
    W->>I: earnWelcomeItem (idempotent)
    W->>S: schedule deliverWelcome(path, nextQuest, finishedSteps)
    S-->>W: welcomeDelivered(delivered | gone)
    W->>A: dm sent{kind: welcome-hug}
  end
